 agent.\r\n  COMPACT_EXIT_WIDTH/HEIGHT (84/26) only\r\n  applies once already compact.\r\n  Existing focused test: \u001b[38;5;114mtests/test_agent_wor\r\n\u001b[38;5;252m  \u001b[38;5;110mkspace.py\u001b[38;5;252m::test_compact_presentation_uses_t\r\n  wo_dimensional_hysteresis pins both width\r\n  and height behavior.\r\n  Recorder"]
